WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.459
Eddy looked at the new bridge.

2
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.556
"Oh boy!" he said.

3
00:00:17.557 --> 00:00:21.585
He drove closer.

4
00:00:21.586 --> 00:00:23.622
Eddy looked up.

5
00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:26.393
He saw clouds.

6
00:00:26.394 --> 00:00:32.857
Then Eddy looked down.

7
00:00:32.858 --> 00:00:36.061
The ground was far below.

8
00:00:36.062 --> 00:00:38.133
There was a river.

9
00:00:38.134 --> 00:00:40.348
It looked tiny.

10
00:00:40.349 --> 00:00:44.664
Eddy gulped.

11
00:00:44.665 --> 00:00:48.652
"We're up very high!" he thought.

12
00:00:48.653 --> 00:00:53.220
"Who's going first?" Ms. Fender asked.

13
00:00:53.221 --> 00:00:56.349
"Not me!" said Dipper.

14
00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:59.858
"Not me!" said Jeb.

15
00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:03.039
"Not me!" said Poppy.

16
00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.559
"The bridge is too high!"

17
00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.389
"Don't be scared," said Ms. Fender.

18
00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:16.172
"The bridge is very safe."

19
00:01:16.173 --> 00:01:22.051
Then Ms. Fender saw Eddy.

20
00:01:22.052 --> 00:01:25.714
"Oh, Eddy!" said Ms. Fender.

21
00:01:25.715 --> 00:01:37.282
"You don't seem scared.

22
00:01:37.283 --> 00:01:43.375
Do you want to go first?"

